@[Link("Producer")]

#{
  @brief Read Producer's module variables from a later unit's initialiser.
  @details The whole point is the ordering: `_V_init_Producer` has already
           returned by the time this runs, so anything it released on its way
           out is released now.
#}
raise "module variable 'held' did not survive its own initialiser" if not held_is_intact()
raise "module variable 'kept' did not survive its own initialiser" if not kept_is_intact()
